(text "Passive electrome path: INA121 -> 60 Hz notch -> 20 Hz LPF -> AD7124 AIN0/1" (at 20 22 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5f0101ae-d2b4-58d3-830f-68612a2e1527))
(text "Passive path (orange): PASS_INP(V+) - PASS_INN(REF) -> INA121 G=3.994 -> bootstrapped twin-T 60 Hz notch -> 2nd-order SK LPF 20 Hz -> AD7124 AIN0 vs AIN1." (at 20 28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0fccfd4a-fcc3-5341-88c3-712222eee730))
(text "ADC guardrail: INA REF = VCM_1V25 = REFOUT/2, so AIN0 = 1.25 V + 4*Vd and AIN1 = 1.25 V. AD7124 gain 1, buffers on: AIN window 0.1..3.2 V" (at 20 30.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0ce346bc-2d29-538b-8835-a5c2b20a987e))
(text "  -> usable input |Vd| <= 250 mV (AIN0 0.25..2.25 V). R315 1k + D301 BAV199 to +3V3A/AGND clamp AIN0 if the +-5 V chain rails; C314/C315 = ADC kick-back caps." (at 20 33.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1e76b460-689b-5660-8722-e16360b0f096))
(text "Guard: RG split into R301/R302; GUARD_CM = (V+ + REF)/2 buffered by U303A drives all five cable shields (no loading of the electrodes)." (at 20 35.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d9ce3e8d-ce20-5bed-8d8b-9e2155819bac))
(text "OPA4192 instead of OPA4140: OPA140 input CM range ends at V+ - 3.5 V (=1.0 V at 4.5 V rail), below the 1.25 V bias." (at 20 38.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e3846340-80c7-5d35-84a9-821b039d4ecf))
